<title>INDIA: India produces 11,115 tonnes zinc in February.</title>
<headline>India produces 11,115 tonnes zinc in February.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 11,115 tonnes of zinc in February 1997 against a target of 13,550 tonnes, a government statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	   Installed  February,1997    Cumulative output</p>
<p>	   capacity   -------------    -------------------</p>
<p>	   (annual)    Actual	  Apr96-Feb97 Apr95-Feb96</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> HZL     149,000	8,600	   99,649	 104,207</p>
<p> BZL	20,000	2,515	   26,746	  24,384</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Total   169,000     11,115	  126,395	 128,591</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional.</p>
</text>
